  "translation": "Na Gaal i lukim ⟨את⟩ ol man, na i tok long Zebul: Lukim, wanpela lain man i kamdaun long hed bilong ol maunten. Na Zebul i tokim em: Sait bilong ol maunten, ⟨את⟩ em yu lukim, na yu ting em ol man.",
